---
import Avatar from "./Avatar.astro";
import EmailCopy from "./EmailCopy.astro";
import ExternalLink from "./ExternalLink.astro";
---

<section aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="-ml-6 mb-3 w-fit reveal">
    <Avatar />
  </div>

  <h1 id="intro-title" class="mb-6 font-medium text-heading reveal">
    Hi, I’m Fadhil.
  </h1>

  <div class="page-copy reveal-list">
    <p class="reveal">
      I’m a design and full-stack engineer. I like building software and
      figuring out how things work. Right now, I’m working on&#32;
      <ExternalLink href="https://antonvideo.app">Anton&nbsp;Video</ExternalLink>.
      You can also look through my other&#32;
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects">projects</a>,&#32;
      <a class="text-link" href="/ventures">ventures</a>, and past&#32;
      <a class="text-link" href="/experience">experience</a> here.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Outside of work, I’m usually watching anime or reading manga.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      I’m also open to work. Say hello at <EmailCopy />, or find other ways to&#32;
      <a class="text-link" href="/contact">get&nbsp;in&nbsp;touch</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
